 who developed Bitcoin, or the transfer of substantial amounts of Bitcoin from Bitcoin wallets attributed to Mr. Nakamoto;","context":"●disruptions, failures, unavailability or interruptions in service of trading venues for Bitcoin, such as, for example, the announcement by the digital asset exchange FTX Trading Ltd. that it would freeze withdrawals and transfers from its accounts and subsequent filing for bankruptcy protection and the SEC enforcement action brought against Binance Holdings Ltd., which initially sought to freeze all of its assets during the pendency of the enforcement action and has since resulted in Binance Holdings Ltd. discontinuing all fiat deposits and withdrawals in the U.S.;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":522,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-037460","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002070457","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2070457/000121390026037460/ea0280065-10k_twenty.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5bf87400e164857617ca857e4b5dc23a6225171eab8befee7c6a65d9e94a82cf.bin","sha256":"5bf87400e164857617ca857e4b5dc23a6225171eab8befee7c6a65d9e94a82cf"}},{"id":"276b6b3eb5fc94dcdfa4f301f67de2ba7594044eb868f2f0eb7d65af913489b0","quote":"●the development and introduction of new products and services by us;","context":"●the identification of Satoshi Nakamoto, the pseudonymous person or persons who developed Bitcoin, or the transfer of substantial amounts of Bitcoin from Bitcoin wallets attributed to Mr. Nakamoto;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":523,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-037460","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002070457","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2070457/000121390026037460/ea0280065-10k_twenty.htm"